<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;netcoreapp3.1;net6;net5.0;net7;net8;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
		<GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
		<Version>1.5.0</Version>
		<CopyLocalLockFileAssemblies>true</CopyLocalLockFileAssemblies>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/webgio/Rotativa.AspNetCore</RepositoryUrl>
		<PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/webgio/Rotativa.AspNetCore</PackageProjectUrl>
		<Company>Viva Software di Bozio Giorgio</Company>
		<Authors>Giorgio Bozio</Authors>
		<Description>Rotativa: PDF easy creation for Asp.Net Core, Asp.Net 6, Asp.Net 8 and Asp.Net 10</Description>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>1.5.0
- Added .NET 10 support. The package targets .NET Standard 2.0, .NET Core 3.1, .NET 5, 6, 7, 8 and 10.
- .NET Standard 2.0 (used by .NET Framework apps): the Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc dependency moves from 2.2.0 to 2.3.13, which brings patched versions of Newtonsoft.Json, System.Text.Encodings.Web and System.Security.Cryptography.Xml. ASP.NET Core 2.3 is the version Microsoft supports on .NET Framework; it is based on 2.1, so apps that use ASP.NET Core 2.2 packages will be moved up to 2.3.13 and any 2.2-only APIs are not available.
- Linux and macOS: Rotativa looks for wkhtmltopdf and wkhtmltoimage without the .exe extension. Use the native builds for your platform from https://wkhtmltopdf.org/downloads.html.
- No changes to the public API.</PackageReleaseNotes>
		<PackageTags>PDF AspNetCore</PackageTags>
		<Copyright>2026 Viva Software di Bozio Giorgio</Copyright>
		<PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
		<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
		<!-- Check the package's API across target frameworks and against the last published release.
		     Intentional differences are listed in CompatibilitySuppressions.xml. -->
		<EnablePackageValidation>true</EnablePackageValidation>
		<PackageValidationBaselineVersion>1.4.0</PackageValidationBaselineVersion>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<!--<ItemGroup>
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions" Version="7.0.0" />
	</ItemGroup>-->

	<ItemGroup Condition=" '$(TargetFramework)' != 'netstandard2.0' ">
		<FrameworkReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.App" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup Condition=" '$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.0'">
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc" Version="2.3.13" />
		<!--<FrameworkReference Include="System.Web.Mvc" />-->
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
	</ItemGroup>

